PNM Viewer Toolkit - Component Licensing

PNM Viewer Toolkit uses different licenses for different components. This is not a
choice of either license for every file.

Apache License, Version 2.0 (SPDX: Apache-2.0)
--------------------------------------------
The reusable Rust libraries under crates/ and project-owned development tooling
are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full license is in:

    LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

GNU General Public License, Version 3 only (SPDX: GPL-3.0-only)
-----------------------------------------------------------
The desktop shell and React/TypeScript UI under apps/desktop/ are licensed
GPL-3.0-only, as identified by their package metadata and source headers.
The full license is in:

    LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt

Component scope and third-party material
---------------------------------------
Package license metadata and source-file SPDX headers identify the applicable
component license. Preserve existing copyright statements and notices.
Third-party dependencies, copied fixtures, reference documents and specification
extracts retain their own licensing and terms; this notice does not relicense
them. See NOTICE and tests/fixtures/pypnm/LICENSE and NOTICE for PyPNM material.

This component split follows the original PNM Viewer bootstrap requirements,
preserved in skills/pnm-viewer-development/references/bootstrap-guide.md.
